      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sin of Judah",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.17.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.17.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "written with a pen of iron,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.17.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.17.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with the point of a diamond:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.17.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.17.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "graven upon the table of their heart, and upon the horns of your altars;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Whilst their children remember their altars and their groves by the green trees upon the high hills.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O my mountain in the field, I will give thy substance",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.17.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.17.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "all thy treasures to the spoil,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.17.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.17.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thy high places for sin, throughout all thy borders.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And thou, even thyself, shalt discontinue from thine heritage that I gave thee; and I will cause thee to serve thine enemies in the land which thou knowest not: for ye have kindled a fire in mine anger,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "which",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.17.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.17.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall burn for ever.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Thus saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.17.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.17.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; Cursed",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.17.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.17.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the man that trusteth in man, and maketh flesh his arm, and whose heart departeth from the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.17.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.17.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For he shall be like the heath in the desert, and shall not see when good cometh; but shall inhabit the parched places in the wilderness,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "in",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.17.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.17.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a salt land and not inhabited.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Blessed",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.17.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.17.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the man that trusteth in the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.17.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.17.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and whose hope the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.17.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.17.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "is.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For he shall be as a tree planted by the waters, and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.17.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.17.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "spreadeth out her roots by the river, and shall not see when heat cometh, but her leaf shall be green; and shall not be careful in the year of drought, neither shall cease from yielding fruit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ The heart",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.17.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.17.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "deceitful above all",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "things",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.17.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.17.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and desperately wicked: who can know it?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.17.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.17.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "search the heart,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "I",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.17.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.17.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "try the reins, even to give every man according to his ways,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.17.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.17.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "according to the fruit of his doings.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "As",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.17.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.17.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the partridge sitteth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "on eggs",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.17.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.17.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and hatcheth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "them",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.17.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.17.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "so",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.17.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.17.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he that getteth riches, and not by right, shall leave them in the midst of his days, and at his end shall be a fool.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ A glorious high throne from the beginning",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.17.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.17.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the place of our sanctuary.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
