          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thus saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.17.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.17.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; Take heed to yourselves, and bear no burden on the sabbath day, nor bring",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.17.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.17.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in by the gates of Jerusalem;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neither carry forth a burden out of your houses on the sabbath day, neither do ye any work, but hallow ye the sabbath day, as I commanded your fathers.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But they obeyed not, neither inclined their ear, but made their neck stiff, that they might not hear, nor receive instruction.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And it shall come to pass, if ye diligently hearken unto me, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.17.24",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.17.24"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", to bring in no burden through the gates of this city on the sabbath day, but hallow the sabbath day, to do no work therein;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then shall there enter into the gates of this city kings and princes sitting upon the throne of David, riding in chariots and on horses, they, and their princes, the men of Judah, and the inhabitants of Jerusalem: and this city shall remain for ever.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they shall come from the cities of Judah, and from the places about Jerusalem, and from the land of Benjamin, and from the plain, and from the mountains, and from the south, bringing burnt offerings, and sacrifices, and meat offerings, and incense, and bringing sacrifices of praise, unto the house of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.17.26",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.17.26"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But if ye will not hearken unto me to hallow the sabbath day, and not to bear a burden, even entering in at the gates of Jerusalem on the sabbath day; then will I kindle a fire in the gates thereof, and it shall devour the palaces of Jerusalem, and it shall not be quenched.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
